      "text": "### Nim question\n\n```cpp\nbool canWinNim(int n) {\n\t// n is between 1 ~ 3: first player win\n\t// n == 4: second player win, 1P lose\n\t// 5 <= n <= 7, 1P can ensure 2P face the n == 4, so 1P win\n\t// n == 8, 1P would be forced to face n == 4 situation, 2P win,  1P lose\n\treturn n % 4 != 0;\n}\n```",
